{"abstract":"We study the growth, complexity, and generativity of a digital platform—Otto.de. Through a longitudinal analysis of the company’s 65 GitHub open source repositories over a period of 6.5 years, we find a) support for a superlinear growth pattern, b) a structural split in the platform into two clusters, and c) indication that more active repositories will be more generative and in turn more popular. These findings have implications for scholars studying platform evolution as well as for companies opening up their internal IT platforms.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Fürstenau, Daniel","Rothe, Hannes","Baiyere, Abayomi","Schulte-Althoff, Matthias","Masak, Dieter","Schewina, Kai","Anisimova, Daria"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-288659"],"event":{"acronym":"ICIS","end":"2019-12-18","place":"Munich, de","start":"2019-12-15","title":"40th International Conference on Information Systems, ICIS 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Freie Universität Berlin","Plenum AG"],"keyword":["Complexity","Digital platforms","GROWTH","Generativity","Platform evolution"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"growth complexity and generativity of digital platforms the case of otto de","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://aisel.aisnet.org/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1582&context=icis2019","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-288659","ids":["cbs-8bd69db7-2d2c-4dfe-b036-edc6f1b05b93"],"keyword":["Complexity","Digital platforms","Generativity","Growth","Platform evolution"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],